# Read by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify (netlify.toml is Netlify-only).
# Without these, refreshing a clean URL returned 404 on hosts with no
# single-page-app fallback once a 404.html existed.
#
# On Cloudflare Pages the functions/ routes (Public Desk, SEO tool pages,
# calendar proxy) take precedence; these rules are the static fallback.

# Every tool URL is the app, which opens the tool from the path. Targets are
# extensionless: Cloudflare redirects /x.html to /x, which would drop the path.
/tools/*   /   200

# Public Desks: a page that loads the Desk in the browser.
/u/*       /u   200
